  ('mth-206-advanced-mathematics-vi', 'MTH 206: Advanced Mathematics VI', 'University of Nigeria, Nsukka', 'Faculty of Physical Sciences, Faculty of Engineering', 'Mathematics', '200 Level', 'If $\vec r(t) = (4 t^{2} - 3 t + 4, 4 t + 3, - 4 t^{2} + t + 2)$, find $\vec r''(t)$.', '["$(8 t - 3, 4, 1 - 8 t)$", "$(8 t - 2, 4, 1 - 8 t)$", "$(8 t - 3, 3, 1 - 8 t)$", "$(4 t^{2} - 3 t + 4, 4 t + 3, - 4 t^{2} + t + 2)$"]'::jsonb, 0, 'Differentiating each component: $\vec r''(t) = (8 t - 3, 4, 1 - 8 t)$.', 'Differentiation of Vectors', false, 'second', 2),
