  ('mth-206-advanced-mathematics-vi', 'MTH 206: Advanced Mathematics VI', 'University of Nigeria, Nsukka', 'Faculty of Physical Sciences, Faculty of Engineering', 'Mathematics', '200 Level', 'If $\vec r(t) = (2 t^{2} + 2 t + 1, t^{2} + 2 t + 1, 4 t^{2} + 3 t + 2)$, find $\vec r''(t)$.', '["$(4 t + 2, 2 t + 2, 8 t + 3)$", "$(4 t + 3, 2 t + 2, 8 t + 3)$", "$(4 t + 2, 2 t + 1, 8 t + 3)$", "$(2 t^{2} + 2 t + 1, t^{2} + 2 t + 1, 4 t^{2} + 3 t + 2)$"]'::jsonb, 0, 'Differentiating each component: $\vec r''(t) = (4 t + 2, 2 t + 2, 8 t + 3)$.', 'Differentiation of Vectors', false, 'second', 2),
