  ('mth-206-advanced-mathematics-vi', 'MTH 206: Advanced Mathematics VI', 'University of Nigeria, Nsukka', 'Faculty of Physical Sciences, Faculty of Engineering', 'Mathematics', '200 Level', 'For $f(x,y) = 2 x^{2} y + 2 x y^{2} - 3 x y$, find $\partial f/\partial y$.', '["$2 x^{2} + 4 x y - 3 x$", "$4 x y + 2 y^{2} - 3 y$", "$2 x^{2} + 4 x y - 2 x$", "$2 x^{2} + 4 x y - 3 x - y$"]'::jsonb, 0, 'Differentiating with respect to $y$, treating $x$ as constant: $\partial f/\partial y = 2 x^{2} + 4 x y - 3 x$.', 'Partial Differentiation', false, 'second', 2),
